I wake up in the morning.
My home in Mumbai is quiet now.
Today is a typical workday.
I go to the kitchen.
I make fresh coffee.
I drink the hot coffee.
It is very tasty.
Now I get ready for the office.
I put things in the bag.
I put the laptop in the bag.
I also put the lunch box there.
Where are my keys and wallet?
Oh, the keys are on the table.
The wallet is also right there.
I put the keys and wallet in the bag.
Now everything is ready.
I take the bag.
I go outside the house.
I put the lock on the door.
Then I go towards the bus stop.
